<title>CANADA: Moffat to acquire Florida cable system.</title>
<headline>Moffat to acquire Florida cable system.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moffat Communications Ltd said on Thursday that it has reached an agreement in principle with Benchmark Communciations to acquire the cable television system serving Palm Beach, Florida.</p>
<p>The value of the transaction is about US$29.6 million, Moffat said in a statement.</p>
<p>The agreement is subject to due diligence and a definitive agreement reached before October 15.</p>
<p>The cable system is expected to serve about 10,000 subscribers. The anticipated closing date is December 31.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
